The set of rules governing how names interact when combining program fragments, addressing whether bindings ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/shadowing.td")}, conflict, or merge (central to understanding ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/substitution.td")}, ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/scope.td")}, and module composition).

